values ('hyperboost-edge', 'Hyperboost Edge', 'Hyperboost', 'Comfort Energized', 200, 'hyperboost-edge-hero.jpg', '["This season''s featured push — the do-it-all super trainer.","HYPERBOOST PRO foam: pelletized, racing-derived, tuned for soft landings and a springy toe-off.","PRIMEWEAVE woven upper — super soft, lightweight, locks the foot in.","LIGHTTRAXION full-length outsole for traction on any surface.","45mm heel / 39mm forefoot, 6mm drop — one of the tallest stacks in the lineup. ~9.1 oz.","Sell it as: plush, energized, everyday comfort — not race-day firm."]'::jsonb, 8, 10)
